For Flemming and all others attempting to compile NetHack on VMS --

READ THE DIRECTIONS!!!

Seriously, it's there.  Well, I got mine from acdurs.ucar.edu (128.117.32.2),
in the directory [.SRC.NETHACK], which I think is a better place to get it for
VMS.  You have to define a logical TERMCAP pointing to the TERMCAP. file in
[.OTHERS], then it will work fine.

(Lest I sound too smug, I asked the same question to someone [I forget who],
and he told me the same thing.  Live and learn.)

